    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13260" root="دهر" body-key="d">
    
      Q. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَدَهْوَرَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (sand) <i>poured down, and
for the most part fell.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,
<i>He,</i> or <i>it, fell down, from a higher to a lower
place.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>It</i> (the night) <i>for the
most part went:</i> (Msb:) or <i>departed,</i> or <i>retreated.</i> (K, TA.)

